# pnpm debris. This repo installs with npm -- .github/workflows/assessor.yml
# runs `npm ci` and package-lock.json is the tracked lockfile. These two files
# are regenerated by scripts/debug.test.ts and scripts/chat.test.ts, which shell
# out to `pnpm exec`; pnpm writes them on the way to its build-approval gate.
